Magic trap if there is one not too far from the altar is also nice.

My first altar camping was done on a level with magic trap. Between the
monsters generated by the trap and the randdom bunch of orcs generated
while carrying corpses, I had time to sacrifice a lot. Plus I emptied all
my wands/bags there.

Remember also that since you have Mojo, one of the best artefact in the
game, you probably don't want to sacrifice to get another artefact (don't
get the skills limits right at hand, maybe one of the brand could be
raised higher for ranger but chances of getting lots of foobanes are
high). So just #pray asap and hope for the spellbooks/protection.

